---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Disclaimer from '../components/Disclaimer.astro';

const base = (import.meta.env.BASE_URL ?? '/').replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<BaseLayout title="AI Pre-Mortem Engine — imagine failure before launch" description="Describe a project before launch. Get 10 plausible failure scenarios — each with narrative, probability/severity, a historical precedent and early-warning signals.">
<section class="hero">
  <span class="hero-badge">A “future investigator” looks back</span>
  <h1 class="display-1">Imagine the failure<br/><span class="grad-text">before it happens.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Describe a project before launch. Get 10 plausible failure scenarios from a “future investigator” — each with narrative, probability / severity, a real historical precedent, and early-warning signals — plus a risk matrix, mitigation plans, and a shareable report.</p>
  <div class="hero-ctas">
<a href={`${base}/submit`} class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Run a pre-mortem</a>
<a href={`${base}/history`} class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">See past pre-mortems</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-meta">
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg>Probability × severity matrix</span>
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V2H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 4.5v15zM4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 6.5 22H20v-5"/></svg>Historical precedents per scenario</span>
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15v3M12 10v8M17 6v12"/></svg>CSV + markdown export</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="grid-3">
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">10 failure scenarios</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Written as a report from the future — what went wrong, and why.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Risk matrix</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Every scenario plotted probability × severity, coloured by category.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V2H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 4.5v15zM4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 6.5 22H20v-5"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Real precedents</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Each failure is anchored to something that actually happened.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"/><path d="M12 12 19 5"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Early-warning signals</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">The observable signs that the failure is starting — before it lands.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Mitigation plans</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Pick scenarios and plan countermeasures per failure mode.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15v3M12 10v8M17 6v12"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Shareable report</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Export the action plan as CSV and the full pre-mortem as markdown.</p>
</article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reveal">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Showcase</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">The risk matrix, at a glance</h2>
    <p class="lead">Probability × severity, coloured by category — rendered live from your scenarios.</p>
  </div>

<div class="card p-5" style="max-width: 40rem; margin: 0 auto">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 text-center text-xs">
    <div></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">medium</div><div class="eyebrow">high</div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#c2372c">critical</div>
    <div class="eyebrow" style="padding-top:.5rem">high</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2" style="background:#fef3c7">team ×2</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2 font-bold" style="background:#fee2e2">technical</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2 font-bold" style="background:#fecaca">dependency</div>
    <div class="eyebrow" style="padding-top:.5rem">medium</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2" style="background:#f1f5f9">market</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2" style="background:#fef3c7">execution</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2" style="background:#fee2e2">unknown</div>
    <div class="eyebrow" style="padding-top:.5rem">low</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2" style="background:#f1f5f9">market</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2" style="background:#f1f5f9">execution</div>
    <div class="rounded-lg p-2" style="background:#fef3c7">technical</div>
  </div>
</div>

</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Three steps, no fluff</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">01</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Describe the project</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Name, type, launch date, team size, dependencies, known risks.</p>
</div>
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">02</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Read the report</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Ten scenarios with precedents and warnings, plotted on the risk matrix.</p>
</div>
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">03</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Plan mitigations</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Select scenarios, plan countermeasures, export the action plan.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reveal">
  <div class="note-band">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
    <p>Speculative planning aid — not a prediction. Failure scenarios are generated for structured planning discussion; verify assumptions independently.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="cta-band reveal">
    <h2 class="section-title">Launch day is coming.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin: 0.8rem auto 1.8rem">Spend ten minutes in the future where it failed.</p>
    <a href={`${base}/submit`} class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Run a pre-mortem</a>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
